                              {row.list ? (
                                <ul class="wb-company-list__services" lang="en">
                                  {row.list.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
                                </ul>
                              ) : (
                                <p class="wb-company-list__ja">{row.ja}</p>
                              )}
                              <p class="wb-company-list__en" lang={row.list ? "ja" : "en"}>{row.en}</p>
                            </dd>
                          </div>
                        ))}
                      </dl>
                    </div>
                  </section>

                  <!-- ============ 08 SECURITY & GOVERNANCE ============ -->
                  <section class="wb-row-sec wb-flow" aria-labelledby="governance-title">
                    <div class="wb-row-sec__inner">
                      <h2 id="governance-title" class="reveal wb-row-title" lang="en">SECURITY &amp; GOVERNANCE</h2>
                      <div class="reveal wb-row-sec__body">
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__lead">安心してプロジェクトをお任せいただくために。</p>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__ja">情報管理、セキュリティ、ガバナンス体制の整備に継続して取り組んでいます。業務執行の監督や適切な情報開示のための社内体制づくりを進め、公平で透明性のある意思決定を目指しています。個人情報の取り扱いについては、<a class="wb-inline-link" href="/privacy/">プライバシーポリシー</a>をご覧ください。</p>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__en" lang="en">We continue working to strengthen our information management, security, and governance. We are building internal systems for overseeing business execution and appropriate disclosure, aiming for fair and transparent decision-making. For how we handle personal information, please see our Privacy Policy.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </section>

                  <!-- ============ 09 CONTACT ============ -->
                  <section id="contact" class="wb-row-sec wb-flow" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
                    <div class="wb-row-sec__inner">
                      <h2 id="contact-title" class="reveal wb-row-title" lang="en">CONTACT</h2>
                      <div class="reveal wb-row-sec__body">
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__lead">まだ具体的な企画になっていない段階でも構いません。</p>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__ja">たとえば、次のような段階からご相談いただけます。</p>
                        <ul class="wb-consult">
                          {consultCases.map((c) => (
                            <li class="wb-consult__item">
                              <p class="wb-consult__ja">{c.ja.split("|").map((t, i) => <>{i > 0 && <wbr />}{t}</>)}</p>
                              <p class="wb-consult__en" lang="en">{c.en}</p>
                            </li>
                          ))}
                        </ul>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__ja">まずは、考えていることや困っていることをお聞かせください。取り組むべき課題を整理し、必要な支援や進め方を<span class="wb-nobr">一緒に考えます。</span></p>
                        <p class="wb-row-sec__en" lang="en">You don't need a fully defined project to get in touch. Tell us what you have in mind or where you are getting stuck. Together, we will clarify the challenge and work out the support and approach you need.</p>
                        <a href="/contact/" class="link wb-box wb-company__contact"
                          ><div class="wb-box wb-company__contact-text">
                            <p class="text wb-box wb-company__contact-title">プロジェクトについて相談する</p>
                            <p class="text wb-box wb-company__contact-note" lang="en">
                              Discuss a project
                            </p>
                          </div>
                          <i class="icon material-icons wb-box wb-company__contact-icon" aria-hidden="true"
                            ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.59 16.59 13.17 12 8.59 7.41 10 6l6 6-6 6z"/></svg></i
                          ></a
                        >
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </section>
                </div>
                <footer class="wb-box reveal wb-footer">
                  <div class="wb-box reveal wb-footer__inner">
                    <p class="text wb-box reveal wb-footer__copyright">
                      © WONDER BROTHERS INC. All rights reserved.
                    </p>
                    <div class="wb-footer-links">
                      <a href="/privacy/" class="text link wb-box reveal wb-footer__privacy"
                        >Privacy Policy</a
                      >
                      <button type="button" class="text link wb-box reveal wb-footer__privacy wb-cookie-btn" data-wb-consent-open
                        >Cookie設定</button
                      >
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </footer>
              </div>
  </div></div></div>
</Base>
